flowchart LR
  Client[Retail client] -->|external HTTPS| Edge[Edge API]
  Edge -->|typed HTTP| Orders[Orders API]
  Edge -->|typed HTTP| Inventory[Inventory API]
  Edge -->|typed HTTP| Fulfillment[Fulfillment API]
  Orders -->|availability HTTP| Inventory
  Fulfillment -->|order HTTP| Orders
  Fulfillment -->|idempotent reservation HTTP| Inventory

  Orders --> OrdersDb[(Orders database)]
  Inventory --> InventoryDb[(Inventory database)]
  Fulfillment --> FulfillmentDb[(Fulfillment database)]

  Edge -. internal service FQDNs .-> Environment[Azure Container Apps environment]
  Orders -. internal ingress .-> Environment
  Inventory -. internal ingress .-> Environment
  Fulfillment -. internal ingress .-> Environment

  Edge --> Telemetry[OpenTelemetry / Application Insights]
  Orders --> Telemetry
  Inventory --> Telemetry
  Fulfillment --> Telemetry

  EdgeIdentity[Edge identity] --> ACR[Azure Container Registry]
  OrdersIdentity[Orders identity] --> OrdersDb
  InventoryIdentity[Inventory identity] --> InventoryDb
  FulfillmentIdentity[Fulfillment identity] --> FulfillmentDb

  classDef external fill:#d1e7dd,stroke:#0f5132,color:#212529
  classDef internal fill:#cff4fc,stroke:#055160,color:#212529
  classDef data fill:#e2e3e5,stroke:#41464b,color:#212529
